# UI kit

- Layout: `formGrid`, `uiField`, `openSheet`, `respList`, `segmented` from `js/ui.js`.
- No new inline 2–3 column grids in entry/ledger/modals — use `formGrid` (stacks on mobile via CSS).
- Modals on phone: `openSheet` (sticky Save + overflow menu).
- Check mobile at 402px and 440px; optional `?debug=layout`.
